<Layout title="Terms & Conditions | RO Service Support">
  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="page-title">Terms & Conditions</h1>
      <div class="page-content">
        <p>By booking a service with RO Service Support, you agree to the following terms and conditions:</p>
        
        <h2>1. Service Charges</h2>
        <p>The basic inspection and visiting charge is ₹299. Any additional cost for spare parts or major repairs will be communicated to you upfront. Work will only proceed after your approval.</p>

        <h2>2. Warranty Policy</h2>
        <p>We provide a 90-day written warranty on repairs and spare parts installed by our technicians. This warranty does not cover damage caused by customer negligence, voltage fluctuations, or water supply issues.</p>

        <h2>3. Cancellation & Rescheduling</h2>
        <p>If you need to reschedule or cancel your appointment, please inform us at least 2 hours in advance so we can adjust our schedule accordingly.</p>

        <h2>4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>RO Service Support is not liable for any indirect or consequential damages. Our responsibility is limited to the repair or replacement of the faulty parts as per the warranty terms.</p>

        <h2>5. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>We reserve the right to update these terms at any time. Continued use of our services implies acceptance of the updated terms.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>